    "tutorials": [
      [
        [
          "Welcome to the",
          "basic training",
          "course! By the",
          "end of it you",
          "will master the core",
          "mechanics of the game.",
          "It all starts with",
          "a review."
        ],
        [
          "Before you",
          "lies the battlefield,",
          "divided into",
          "separate tiles.",
          "Each tile",
          "has its own owner -",
          "a player, and in",
          "the tiles stand pieces."
        ],
        [
          "Some tiles",
          "are occupied by water -",
          "remember right away:",
          "pieces cannot",
          "enter water, it's",
          "an impassable zone."
        ],
        [
          "To conveniently view",
          "everything around, move",
          "the camera with WASD,",
          "rotate the view using ",
          "QE, and with the mouse wheel",
          "zoom in and out",
          "the camera."
        ],
        [
          "See a piece on the field?",
          "Click on it with the left",
          "mouse button - in",
          "the bottom left corner",
          "its menu will open."
        ],
        [
          "To close the piece's",
          "menu press ESC",
          "- this will deselect",
          "the selected tile."
        ],
        [
          "Many pieces",
          "can move",
          "by jumping to adjacent",
          "tiles. To jump",
          "select a piece (LMB)",
          "and click with the right",
          "mouse button on",
          "an adjacent tile",
          "you want to",
          "move to."
        ],
        [
          "If a tile",
          "belongs to another",
          "player, after the jump",
          "it will become yours.",
          "But you cannot",
          "jump onto a tile",
          "where your forces already",
          "are - it's occupied."
        ],
        [
          "Important: if",
          "on the enemy tile",
          "you jump to",
          "an enemy piece",
          "is already standing - it",
          "will disappear, and yours",
          "will take its place."
        ],
        [
          "Each move",
          "consumes the piece's",
          "combat ability - see its",
          "supply in the piece's menu."
        ],
        [
          "Combat ability",
          "can only be restored",
          "in one way:",
          "end the turn and let",
          "the soldiers rest."
        ],
        [
          "Players take turns,",
          "so when everyone",
          "has made their moves,",
          "control will return",
          "to you."
        ],
        [
          "And finally - quick",
          "movement: to avoid",
          "clicking on every",
          "tile of the path, hold",
          "the Shift key, hover",
          "over a distant tile",
          "and press RMB. The selected",
          "piece will plot",
          "the shortest route itself."
        ],
        [
          "And now let's see",
          "if you're good",
          "for anything at all.",
          "Your first combat",
          "mission - capture",
          "the enemy",
          "capital building."
        ]
      ],
      [
        [
          "Now let's talk about",
          "the numbers that",
          "decide the outcome of battle.",
          "Every piece",
          "has two key",
          "parameters: attack and",
          "defense - they're in",
          "the menu, next to",
          "combat ability."
        ],
        [
          "The rule is simple:",
          "if the defense",
          "of the enemy tile (with",
          "all bonuses included)",
          "is higher than",
          "your piece's attack,",
          "then you can't jump",
          "onto that tile."
        ],
        [
          "Besides, all",
          "pieces project",
          "their defense onto",
          "adjacent tiles,",
          "as if covering",
          "their comrades' backs."
        ],
        [
          "Click on an enemy",
          "piece in order",
          "to see its attack",
          "or defense in the small",
          "window at bottom left. If",
          "there is no window, the selected",
          "piece has neither attack",
          "nor defense - an easy target."
        ],
        [
          "And now pay",
          "attention to the battlefield",
          "- there are new",
          "pieces on it: a bunker and",
          "artillery."
        ],
        [
          "The bunker is a bastion",
          "of defense: it not",
          "only has impressive",
          "defense on its own,",
          "but also buffs",
          "the defense of",
          "adjacent",
          "infantry."
        ],
        [
          "Artillery strikes",
          "from afar - it can",
          "attack the enemy at",
          "a distance of up to three",
          "tiles and destroy",
          "them without direct",
          "contact."
        ],
        [
          "The bunker, despite ",
          "all its might,",
          "is no match for artillery -",
          "one shot at",
          "it is enough."
        ],
        [
          "However,",
          "artillery cannot",
          "move on",
          "its own - it needs",
          "to be attached to infantry.",
          "Then, when the",
          "infantry moves, the artillery",
          "will obediently",
          "roll along behind."
        ],
        [
          "Note: the attached",
          "pair can",
          "make a jump",
          "only if both",
          "pieces have enough",
          "combat ability for it."
        ],
        [
          "And another important",
          "trick: enemy",
          "artillery can",
          "be captured by our",
          "infantryman. For this",
          "move the infantry to",
          "the tile adjacent to the enemy,",
          "open its menu, press",
          "the \"Capture\" button and",
          "click RMB on the enemy",
          "piece."
        ],
        [
          "But be careful:",
          "the capture cannot",
          "be performed if",
          "next to the target",
          "there is enemy",
          "infantry or a bunker -",
          "they will hinder",
          "the operation."
        ],
        [
          "And finally - pay",
          "attention to the swampy",
          "terrain to the north of",
          "us. Under no circumstances",
          "should you bring",
          "artillery into it - once it",
          "ends up there, it",
          "will lose the ability",
          "to attack the enemy,",
          "until you",
          "pull it out of there."
        ],
        [
          "And now deal",
          "with the enemy on",
          "this strange",
          "island - capture its",
          "artillery and crack open",
          "the bunkers it",
          "hides behind."
        ]
      ],
      [
        [
          "And now about what",
          "no army can exist",
          "without - a solid",
          "rear. Pieces don't come",
          "out of thin air, they need",
          "to be created, and that",
          "requires resources."
        ],
        [
          "Look in the top left",
          "corner - your resources",
          "(dollars and ConsGoods)",
          "you will see there.",
          "Each turn they are",
          "brought to you by producing",
          "buildings."
        ],
        [
          "Dollars are brought",
          "by towns.",
          "ConsGoods are produced",
          "by factories, spending",
          "dollars on it."
        ],
        [
          "And finally, the main",
          "secret of an efficient",
          "economy - the",
          "capital building. It",
          "doubles",
          "the output",
          "of all adjacent",
          "towns and factories,",
          "while - the resources",
          "they spend remain",
          "the same."
        ],
        [
          "Enemy capitals,",
          "towns and factories",
          "can be captured",
          "by infantry - just like",
          "artillery."
        ],
        [
          "Now let's try",
          "to spend resources on",
          "creating a piece. When",
          "no tile is selected,",
          "in place of the piece",
          "menu there are buttons",
          "for creating pieces - those of",
          "them for which",
          "you have enough resources",
          "are marked with color."
        ],
        [
          "You should have enough",
          "dollars to create",
          "a factory - click on",
          "the corresponding button,",
          "and then, using RMB,",
          "select a tile for",
          "construction."
        ],
        [
          "Creating infantry and",
          "artillery works",
          "somewhat differently - they",
          "can only be built",
          "next to producing",
          "buildings."
        ],
        [
          "When you click on",
          "the infantry creation button,",
          "the towns next to which",
          "it can be built",
          "will be highlighted",
          "for you."
        ],
        [
          "Note that a piece cannot",
          "be created on an unsuitable",
          "terrain type, for example -",
          "you won't be able to",
          "build a factory in the mountains,",
          "but artillery will be",
          "quite comfortable there."
        ],
        [
          "Also note: many",
          "pieces require resources",
          "not only on appearance,",
          "but also consume them",
          "each turn. The resources",
          "consumed by a piece",
          "each turn can be",
          "found in its menu."
        ],
        [
          "If at the start of a turn",
          "there aren't enough resources",
          "for upkeep, the piece will",
          "be removed from the field - so",
          "keep an eye on the Flow."
        ],
        [
          "If a factory lacks",
          "raw materials, it",
          "doesn't disappear, but simply",
          "idles without",
          "producing output."
        ],
        [
          "Besides the resource stock",
          "in the top left corner",
          "the expected growth",
          "for the next turn is",
          "also displayed (in",
          "parentheses), but remember:",
          "possible idle time",
          "due to lack of resources",
          "is not considered",
          "in this forecast."
        ],
        [
          "Using the knowledge",
          "you've gained, strengthen",
          "the economy, gather",
          "a strong army and",
          "crush your enemies",
          "on this beautiful",
          "island."
        ]
      ],
      [
        [
          "A competent commander",
          "knows how to win not",
          "only by force, but also",
          "by cunning. Why",
          "spill blood where",
          "you can take yours",
          "without a fight?"
        ],
        [
          "If you manage",
          "to encircle a group",
          "of enemy tiles,",
          "that is, fully",
          "cut them off from",
          "the rest of the enemy's",
          "possessions, then at",
          "the end of their turn",
          "these tiles will be",
          "annexed by you."
        ],
        [
          "This is very profitable!",
          "But there is a nuance -",
          "only tiles not",
          "controlled by",
          "the enemy are annexed,",
          "which, moreover,",
          "after annexation we",
          "will be able to control."
        ],
        [
          "Control of tiles is provided",
          "by capitals and infantry.",
          "If in the encircled region",
          "there is an enemy capital,",
          "then it will not be annexed.",
          "And conversely, even unencircled",
          "tiles can be",
          "annexed, in case",
          "they are far from",
          "the nearest capital or",
          "infantry."
        ],
        [
          "However, it should be noted",
          "that infantry provides",
          "control only ",
          "when it is in",
          "the same region as",
          "a capital or else",
          "(if there is no capital),",
          "when it is next to",
          "water - this way it",
          "gets the ability",
          "to be supplied by sea."
        ],
        [
          "If the annexation",
          "does happen,",
          "then all enemy",
          "infantry inside",
          "the encirclement",
          "is disbanded (the soldiers",
          "scatter to their",
          "homes), and all",
          "the other pieces -",
          "pass into your",
          "army safe and sound."
        ],
        [
          "To create encirclements",
          "it's useful to have",
          "high mobility.",
          "Regular infantry can",
          "get wheels -",
          "mount",
          "a transport and",
          "turn into",
          "motorized infantry."
        ],
        [
          "This gives a huge",
          "plus: the supply",
          "of combat ability for",
          "motorized infantry is much",
          "larger than on foot,",
          "and it can also",
          "attach to itself",
          "artillery."
        ],
        [
          "Moreover, motorized",
          "infantry, just like",
          "regular infantry,",
          "provides control over",
          "tiles - use",
          "this so as not to lose",
          "territory for nothing."
        ],
        [
          "But there's also a minus -",
          "capturing",
          "enemy pieces",
          "motorized infantry is no longer",
          "capable of, for this",
          "you need specifically on-foot",
          "soldiers."
        ],
        [
          "This whole island",
          "is overgrown with dense forest,",
          "in which our",
          "artillery is useless.",
          "The enemy, knowing this, has well",
          "fortified and brought their",
          "motorized infantry to",
          "push us out of here."
        ],
        [
          "Urgently gather some wheels",
          "and tear their lands",
          "to shreds."
        ]
      ],
      [
        [
          "Now about heavy",
          "equipment. An enemy",
          "bunker that infantry",
          "can't handle,",
          "can be destroyed",
          "by a tank."
        ],
        [
          "Tanks, like artillery,",
          "are allowed to be captured",
          "by infantry. A tank can",
          "attack the enemy, but",
          "only on an adjacent",
          "tile - point-blank."
        ],
        [
          "A tank's strength grows",
          "if nearby there is",
          "infantry or motorized infantry:",
          "combat comrades cover",
          "the armor, and the tank's attack and defense",
          "are increased."
        ],
        [
          "A lone tank,",
          "meanwhile - is easy",
          "prey. Even regular",
          "infantry can",
          "destroy it."
        ],
        [
          "Creating your own",
          "tank is no easy task -",
          "the available means",
          "won't do here.",
          "Meet a new",
          "resource - HeavyMach, it is",
          "produced by heavy factories,",
          "spending on it",
          "dollars and ConsGoods."
        ],
        [
          "A heavy factory, just like",
          "a factory, gets a bonus",
          "from adjacency to",
          "a capital, and",
          "enemy heavy factories can",
          "be captured by infantry."
        ],
        [
          "As for the passability",
          "of tanks - they are one of",
          "the few able to fight",
          "in the desert, however in mountains",
          "and swamps don't expect",
          "anything from them."
        ],
        [
          "Look at this poor",
          "island, it has for many",
          "years been engulfed in eternal",
          "war - it's time",
          "to bring order here."
        ]
      ],
      [
        [
          "Producing buildings don't always",
          "have to be built by you.",
          "Resource producers can",
          "appear on your",
          "territories by themselves - we're talking",
          "about privateers (alternative",
          "versions of towns,",
          "factories and heavy factories)."
        ],
        [
          "To appear they require",
          "unoccupied plains",
          "and the absence of state",
          "control (the fewer",
          "capitals, the more",
          "privateers)."
        ],
        [
          "Privateers are less efficient",
          "than productions in your",
          "possession, since they still",
          "need to make a profit.",
          "At the same time, each privateer",
          "can be purchased - turned",
          "into a regular producing building."
        ],
        [
          "Another difference - a privateer",
          "won't tolerate the absence of",
          "the resources it needs",
          "for production -",
          "in case of a deficit it will abandon",
          "its production."
        ],
        [
          "An abandonment not only",
          "gratuitously consumes",
          "the state budget, it also",
          "infects producing",
          "buildings nearby."
        ],
        [
          "Starting from this moment",
          "bunkers located",
          "at a great distance",
          "from the front will also",
          "turn into abandonments -",
          "no point building them in the rear!"
        ],
        [
          "The good news is",
          "that abandonments, like all",
          "buildings you don't need,",
          "can be demolished by shots",
          "from tanks and artillery -",
          "use this to",
          "prevent their",
          "spread."
        ],
        [
          "And finally, spare",
          "infantry can always",
          "settle - turn",
          "them into settlements.",
          "This will help save",
          "the economy in a difficult",
          "hour."
        ]
      ],
      [
        [
          "The enemy on this island",
          "knew in advance about our",
          "arrival and was able to invest heavily",
          "in static",
          "defense - luckily for us",
          "we had our man in",
          "the western province who",
          "sabotaged the construction."
        ],
        [
          "Alas, to the east we'll have to",
          "break through countless",
          "rows of bunkers. Here a new",
          "piece will come to our",
          "aid - the Grad. Spending on each",
